d the only surveys on file are older, partisan-sponsored polls showing Finstad ahead by three to ten points.\n\nEvery major expert rater calls the race Likely R, with two outlets at Lean R and one at Safe R, and prediction markets give Finstad about a three-to-one edge. The forecast lands on a Republican margin in the mid-single digits, consistent with the district's fundamentals and the ratings consensus, while acknowledging genuine but limited upset potential for Johnson.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1904, "margin": -5.38}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.19, "margin": -6.5}]}